        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While Indian Railways offers car transport by train, it involves multiple handling points, limited scheduling, and longer transit times. Our road‑based Car Transportation In Srirampore provides door‑to‑door service, real‑time tracking, and a guaranteed delivery window, making it faster and safer for most customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for car shifting from Srirampore to another city?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid registration certificate, insurance policy, a government‑issued ID, and a signed e‑Way bill for interstate moves. Our team prepares the paperwork, files GST invoices, and ensures compliance with IBA mover code and ISO‑9001 standards, simplifying the claim process for corporate reimbursements.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there an option for full insurance coverage for a brand‑new car during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We provide 100% declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards. For new car delivery, the policy can be customized to match the vehicle’s market value, giving you peace of mind throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost of car transportation in Srirampore calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our pricing model combines distance‑based mileage, vehicle size, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special packaging needs. All taxes (GST) and regulatory fees are included in the final quote, with no hidden charges. The transparent cost breakdown is presented before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken during loading and unloading on the hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Trained technicians operate the hydraulic ramps, aligning the vehicle perfectly with the trailer floor. Wheel chocks, strap‑down systems, and cushioned edge protectors secure the car. Continuous CCTV monitoring and GPS tracking ensure the vehicle is protected from both road vibrations and external impacts.</p>
